        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721940/extras/3530c298c4ba6e31c89973a33b61463d.avif?t=1764999107\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asuna Hoshizuki is beautiful, loudmouthed, and hits like a freight train. A jobless dropout, she doesn't have much of a life, but she has a loving mother and a family restaurant she helps out at. But after a run-in with a band of yakuza, she finds herself deep in debt to a crime family. With a net worth amounting to a few loose coins and some pocket lint, she's left with no choice but to work for the very men she's indebted to. But in the process, she learns about a secret underground world, a cyberpunk city hidden from sight. Now to pay off her debt, Asuna will have to use her incredible strength to help the Matsuba Clan seize control of the crime-ridden Undercity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721940/extras/2869e13cf484553cf18212ed7d56a996.avif?t=1764999107\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story of crime and gang warfare as you fight your way through eight procedurally generated dungeons full of machine soldiers and superpowered weaponry, and explore a skill tree with numerous ways to power up your character as you overcome this traditional turn-based RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721940/extras/3747ffd82637117c51e4c184796f496f.avif?t=1764999107\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721940/extras/8ddec1494f1560d7c6b55ce94dff7714.avif?t=1764999107\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721940/extras/2945e20fd0a3d0795d2ab945ee26be35.avif?t=1764999107\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A Cyberpunk Yakuza-Themed Story</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a cyberpunk world and the city's dangerous underbelly! Get entangled with the yakuza and struggle to regain your freedom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Eight Special Dungeons</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore eight procedurally generated dungeons as you battle your way to freedom through traditional turn-based combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Skill Tree</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock passive and active skills through an expansive skill tree! Level up or use items to farm skill points and turn Asuna into an unbeatable hero!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721940/extras/3530c298c4ba6e31c89973a33b61463d.avif?t=1764999107\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asuna Hoshizuki is beautiful, loudmouthed, and hits like a freight train. A jobless dropout, she doesn't have much of a life, but she has a loving mother and a family restaurant she helps out at. But after a run-in with a band of yakuza, she finds herself deep in debt to a crime family. With a net worth amounting to a few loose coins and some pocket lint, she's left with no choice but to work for the very men she's indebted to. But in the process, she learns about a secret underground world, a cyberpunk city hidden from sight. Now to pay off her debt, Asuna will have to use her incredible strength to help the Matsuba Clan seize control of the crime-ridden Undercity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721940/extras/2869e13cf484553cf18212ed7d56a996.avif?t=1764999107\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story of crime and gang warfare as you fight your way through eight procedurally generated dungeons full of machine soldiers and superpowered weaponry, and explore a skill tree with numerous ways to power up your character as you overcome this traditional turn-based RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721940/extras/3747ffd82637117c51e4c184796f496f.avif?t=1764999107\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721940/extras/8ddec149